lmm:DataObject rdfs:seeAlso :DataObjectConcept .
lmm:ITComponent rdfs:seeAlso :ITComponentConcept .
lmm:SaaS rdfs:seeAlso :SaaSConcept .
lmm:PaaS rdfs:seeAlso :PaaSConcept .
lmm:IaaS rdfs:seeAlso :IaaSConcept .
lmm:Software rdfs:seeAlso :SoftwareConcept .
